Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Cherish your memories while you can,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,my dear, for soon you'll forget everyone\Nand everything you've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All right then,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.53,0:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I'll summon Machiora\Nthe Destructor in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Next I'll add this all-powerful magic\Ncard, the Mystical Black Pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Pendant's dark magic raises my\Nmonster's attack strength by 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.11,0:02:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Merrick's monster is stronger\Nthan my unfriendly Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.91,0:02:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A millennium's worth of ancient\Nmagical powers against a mere mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to say goodbye to\Nanother one of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Mackie, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-claw slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazon archers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your monster's attack\Npoints are reduced by 500,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,bringing them back where they started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my monster's turn to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, unfriendly Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Soaring slash attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.99,0:02:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe that will erase someone from your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:03:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,mind why thank you there's no one in my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,mind worth remembering i prefer to be all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,alone so attack my monsters and remove my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,servants from my mind given the choice\Ni forget every single one of them you're
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,nuts perhaps but i'm sane enough to have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Caught you in my trap.\NYou see, when a monster
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.41,0:03:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,wearing the black pendant is destroyed\Nits opponent loses 500 life points and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's another penalty for\Nyou to pay my dear by sending Makiura the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,destructor to the graveyard you've activated\Nits special ability which allows me to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.37,0:03:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,play any trap card I want from my hand and\NI think it will serve me best to activate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this one, Rope of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.15,0:03:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This card brings a monster\Nback from my graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and empowers it with\N800 extra attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So say goodbye to your unfriendly Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:03:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mechiora the Destructor,\Nattack her Amazon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,As she goes, so goes your\Nmemory of another friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how does it feel to have your\Nmind wiped clean of two dear friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's slipping away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels just like the loneliness\NI felt when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My family always moving,\Nnever having any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents always too busy\Nto spend time with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I had nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after I got my first job\Nand discovered Duel Monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was still just a lonely kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The powerful Harpy cards I kept in my deck\Nwere the closest things I had to friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But as cool and powerful\Nas my Harpies were,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.85,0:05:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,deep down inside, I\Nknew they weren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I pretty much decided that I was just\Nmeant to be alone, to play by my own rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.85,0:05:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Until that day on the boat to Duelist\NKingdom, when everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I saw those guys, I felt\Nsomething I'd never felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the more I hung out with them,\Nthe more they began to grow on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good imitation of Kyber, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.97,0:05:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, they were a little weird at\Ntimes, but they were nice weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon my loneliness was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I'm losing the only\Nreal friends I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm just a lonely kid again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, feel the pain, the heartbreak,\Nthe torment of losing your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.13,0:05:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No one said Shadow Games were pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memory of Joey has been erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.35,0:06:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ground control to Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,First she ignores Taya,\Nand now she's ignoring me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not ignoring you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This shadow game has made\Nher forget who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mai, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.69,0:06:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you forget a mug like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Joey Wheeler,\Nduelist extraordinaire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.65,0:06:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If Merrick's gonna use\NShadow powers to hurt me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.33,0:06:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'm gonna use them to help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Two can play at this mind game!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to show My the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs to know that she won't be\Nwandering alone in the shadows forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's only one way for me to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.39,0:06:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,By using my own millennium powers\Nto penetrate Merrick's shadow game!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And enter Mai's mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not alone, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, it's me. Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let Merrick's illusions\Ndistract you. Illusions? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole thing's a fantasy,\Nbut it all seems so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But only because the world you're in now\Nis making it seem real. Win this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll shed light on the truth and\Nreturn to life as you knew it but yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,what is it i don't know if i can i feel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,so empty inside fight it my but i'm all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,alone i have nothing left hey mom we're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here for you. Who is that? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the voice but something about it is\Nfamiliar yes my listen it's the voice of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,your friends who continue to support you\Nand you can rest assured that no matter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,how dark it seems in these shadows those
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,voices are always
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,there okay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,be strong
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,my it's all up to you now you have to I\Nwant to beat Merrick and free your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.49,0:08:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know you can beat this evil freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's that voice again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Yugi's right, and\NI'm not as alone as I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare that little runt\Nintrude on my shadow game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.09,0:08:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the danger perhaps a\Nlittle too real for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head games don't\Nscare me, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But realize when I'm through with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,your brain will be nothing\Nbut an empty shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.95,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, bring it on, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never backed out of a\Nduel and I won't start now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then prepare to lose your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So give the scare tactics a rest and get\Nready, buddy, cause now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I play Amazon\NChainmaster in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play one card face down\Non the field. Now take your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.29,0:09:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,shot tough guy your amazon chain\Nmaster is weak that's what he thinks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but once he tries to attack i'll\Nactivate my secret weapon are you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,ready once maki yura the destructor\Nwipes out your pitiful amazon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chain Master, another piece of your\Nmemory will disappear, so if you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,want to retain what's left of your\Nfleeting intellect i'd advise you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,not to summon such weak monsters\Nto the field or it won't be long
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,before your entire world is shrouded\Nin the fog of complete darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so you think your amazon monster will\Nstop me from wiping away your memories
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.93,0:10:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Holding Arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not look like much, but observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it has only 500 attack\Npoints, it can still stop your monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Holding Arms attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.07,0:10:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,my Holding Arms card\Nhas the ability to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,your monster from\Nattacking for three turns!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.61,0:10:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That should buy me enough time to\Ndestroy you and your mind. Wacko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Mai doesn't let\Nthis creep get to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If she loses this shadow duel to\NMerrick, her mind may never recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, forget these\Nmind games and just duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,These games are how I duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,duel monsters and the shadow\Nrealm are intertwined,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.17,0:10:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm simply playing the game\Nas it was originally intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, fate has selected mine\Nto be the victim of today's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I duel with ancient magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, so do you by tapping\Ninto the powers of the Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but not to spread evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.47,0:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you trying to help and\Nall, but I'm the one dueling here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So please trust me, I can defend\Nmyself from now on, Yu-Gi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not just gonna stand\Nhere and let her keep dueling?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.97,0:11:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mai has made her choice Hope it's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the right one My move Go face down, card
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my all-powerful grave arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card can bury one\Nmonster on the field. Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but my holding arms are\Nstill invincible right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your magic effect won't work on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever said I was going\Nto use it on your monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have other plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using its magic on\Nmy Amazon Chain Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.07,0:12:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I'm destroying her,\Nmy memory stays the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're that desperate to\Nkeep the memory of your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Merrick, that's not the only reason\NI sent my own monster to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So get a load of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Before my Amazon goes to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,she lets me take a card from\Nyour death. Really? Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And the monster I'm taking is your\NEgyptian god card, the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, way to go, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I got Marek's card!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.23,0:12:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look so tough without\Nyour Egyptian god card, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You may possess the winged\Ndragon of Ra for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.69,0:13:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but the only way for you to\Nkeep it is by defeating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I planned to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.09,0:13:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd take it\Nfor a little test drive first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking Marek's Egyptian god\Ncard was an awesome move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all Marek has to do\Nis summon it to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.89,0:13:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,she now holds the most powerful card\Nin Duel Monsters, but can she use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Mai has the Winged\NDragon of Ra, she may win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but it remains to be seen if she has the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,experience necessary to\Nwield a card of such power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.73,0:13:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She's definitely a good\Nduelist, but is she good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I need to sacrifice three monsters\Nin order to summon the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But so far, I have none, and he has\Ntwo, so this won't be easy. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:13:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, waiting for you to kick his butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go get him, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what you need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me that Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place two cards face down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll summon Amazon\NFighter in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you try attacking her, you'll\Nget a very unpleasant surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another week, Amazon? How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eliminate her with ease, along with\Nanother piece of your ever-shrinking mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Machiora the Destructor,\Nattack her Amazon Fighter, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on there, bud, because\Nnow I activate Amazon Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,By playing this magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've instantly swapped\Nthe attack points of your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,monster with the attack\Npoints of my monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazon Fighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:15:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,take out Machiura the Destructor and\Nsomeone else from Merrick's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I never cared much for that fool arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Machiora the\NDisruptor is destroyed. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek's almost down to\Na thousand life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A small price to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,To have you caught deep within my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A trap? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal card of last will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Card of last will? Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,it allows me to draw five\Nnew cards into my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,when one of my monster's\Nattack points is decreased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Merrick, it's a brand new hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.81,0:15:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This could change everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I offer you my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaining five new cards isn't\Nall you've allowed me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,By destroying Makiura, you've\Nactivated its special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll play a card that\Nwill shortly annihilate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.19,0:16:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This shadow game's quite amusing. Now\Nprepare to live out your worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,by way of the trap card nightmare wheel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.69,0:16:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,not only does it trap your amazon fighter
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but the nightmare wheel will also take\N500 life points from you every turn
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.59,0:16:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expecting something\NI couldn't handle. Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd try\Nsomething like this, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So I played this call, Rescue Operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.59,0:16:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This trap card allows me to rescue\Nmy Amazon fighter from your trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It also lets me summon a new\Nmonster to the field now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you going to summon the\NEgyptian god card you took from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I paid attention the\Nlast time it was played.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know if I summoned it now,\Nwithout sacrificing any monsters first,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.39,0:16:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it would have zero attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:17:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play that winged dragon by\Nthe end of my next turn. She crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How's she ever gonna pull that off, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.47,0:17:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.59,0:17:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazon Fighter, return to my hand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And now to summon a new monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this ought to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Cyber Harpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I just need one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If I draw the right card, I'll be able\Nto summon the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.73,0:17:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Graceful Charity. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic card that lets me draw\Nthree new cards from my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I discard two from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,First I'll get rid of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And now let's see if I\Ndrew the card I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:18:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I am so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Merrick, I'm\Ngonna give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The winged dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mai only has one monster on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be smiling for too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.35,0:18:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the magic card Elegant Egotist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Elegant Egotist shall\Nturn my one harpy lady into three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give a big battle city\Nhello to the Harpy Lady sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She got three monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll sacrifice these three lovely
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,ladies and summon the\Nwinged dragon abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:19:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The winged dragon of Ra\Nis now in my control!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.85,0:19:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she really think she\Ncan control an Egyptian god?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.27,0:19:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's quite the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It will control her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The winged dragon of Ra\Nis locked in that sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.27,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But how can I use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't use it, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never unlock its ancient powers.
